omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GCJBZXifEbwQ7kNvwGDyuO5&_nc_oc=AdoEuPZGUWzlY1stmXnanzz8IEMC_iFr9PEB1qm-kHq3_9tzpkjuBRm8JGVF5x00LWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLPagzyiCl7hFmMjUTc1yLsG3wnXnQgGvP6kCQLgji7-g&oe=6AAC05B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n0chDoKLYQ0Q7kNvwFN3-Nl&_nc_oc=Adq5Gro2FceoCD5HbuYN5TaJ1VpcPz914h4jFcT5lOuYR8yDYNPUo9l9vGMAJO3beBs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIVuHuh-ptRDyIpzRc0S1v8yjU_1xuGilulrtCbHdBblQ&oe=6AAC0716"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLJXKBT6EJMQ7kNvwHeKnjY&_nc_oc=Adr0CK08SmtKmPQ00uKKzZ91A-xWcIb69-ndeK0hoqiEJtVAprCRCrqkB0faTvUDo_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLIkJX6StqhRbsWZgkcuk3cxs4yrer7NQw1W_d1p1pIAA&oe=6AABE3F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://